<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">excĭdĭum</span></b> 
		(sometimes written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exscidium</span></b> , as if
		from exscindo), ii, n.
		usually referred to ex-cīdo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>overthrow</i>, <i>demolition</i>, <i>subversion</i>, <i>ruin</i> (especially of cities, buildings, etc.),
				<i>destruction</i> (not freq. till the Aug. per.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not in Caes. and Cic.): urbis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					27, 39 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tac. H. 1, 80</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 76</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				A. 5, 626</span></i>.—In plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">petit urbem excidiis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 505</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. A. 2, 643</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 46</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Liv. 9,
				45</span></i>; <i><span class="en">29, 1
			al.</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">castellorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					4, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arcium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 12, 655</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Libyae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gentium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 98, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tac. H. 5, 25</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cretensium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sall. H. Fragm. p. 290</span></i>
			 ed. Gerl.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">legionum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					4, 61</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">meorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 386</span></i>
			 et saep.</div>
